alink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/test-universal-links-locally-ios-dfjfpljd4","summary":"Universal links are standard HTTP or HTTPS links that one URL works for both the website and the app. When users tap or click a universal link, the system redirects the link directly to the app without routing through Safari or the website. To support Universal Links we need to create a two-way association between your app and your website.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/2d4658b6afc7d3eea78e7e1af2662f4f","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2021-04-02T05:07:54.363Z"},{"id":"Trxegw01i","title":"Test Universal Links Locally iOS","url":"https://santoshbotre01.medium.com/test-universal-links-locally-ios-e0d7a36332a5","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/test-universal-links-locally-ios-trxegw01i","summary":"Universal links are standard HTTP or HTTPS links that one URL works for both the website and the app. When users tap or click a universal link, the system redirects the link directly to the app without routing through Safari or the website. To support Universal Links we need to create a two-way association between your app and your website.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/2d4658b6afc7d3eea78e7e1af2662f4f","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2021-04-01T07:33:50.281Z"},{"id":"Vqi515N6W","title":"Send and Receive SMS Messages with Firebase Functions","url":"https://vonagedev.medium.com/send-and-receive-sms-messages-with-firebase-functions-b34baaad8b12","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/send-and-receive-sms-messages-with-firebase-functions-vqi515n6w","summary":"Use Firebase Cloud Functions and the Real Time Database alongside the Vonage SMS API. Send and Receive SMS Messages with Firebase Functions Vonage Dev Follow Mar 29 \u00b7 6 min read The Firebase platform allows developers to build an application backend rapidly. For this tutorial, I wanted to start using it for some SMS messaging with Vonage.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/3ee798b5da9c493597f4cf7c61c59737","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2021-03-29T10:11:18.802Z"},{"id":"eiFKm_hvR","title":"If and Only If","url":"https://codeburst.io/if-and-only-if-2d58ef7ef027","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/if-and-only-if-eifkm-hvr","summary":"If and Only If: The Performance Cost of Using If Statements and Branch Predictor. Sara Khandaker was practicing her algorithm and data structures on LeetCode. Her solution went from better than 46.58% to 77.17% in runtime and from 15.53% to 40.46% for memory usage.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/336786f96dcebc3b008b5545f0f60683","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2021-03-28T17:28:19.401Z"},{"id":"7s2MTe1ZW","title":"Stop Calling them \u2018Bugs\u2019","url":"https://codeburst.io/stop-calling-them-bugs-370db4691360","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/stop-calling-them-bugs--7s2mte1zw","summary":"A software bug is an error, flaw or fault in a computer program or system that causes it to produce an incorrect or unexpected result. Grace Hopper coined the term while looking for a system malfunction. The term Bug sounds like an excuse out of our scope infecting our systems. Let\u2019s start by calling things by their name.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/9e78630412c3e84d334897307d9282d9","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2021-03-23T15:13:57.700Z"},{"id":"sNXAqNg6j","title":"ASP.NET Core Tutorial","url":"https://codeburst.io/asp-net-core-tutorial-8327f9339df2","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/asp-net-core-tutorial-snxaqng6j","summary":"ASP.NET is the web app building tool for Microsoft's .NET Core platform. It is used extensively for enterprise or cloud-enabled applications and is suitable for MVC full-stack or back-end development. ASP.NE